    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Stonesinger",
    "summary": "As your [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, you may use Elemental Ensnarement if this unit isn’t **battle-shocked**. If you do:\n\n1. Roll 1 D6. A 1 makes this unit battle-shocked.\n2. Pick 1 enemy **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit, other than a **TITANIC** unit, that is **visible** to this unit and within 18\" of it. It is **ensnared** until your next turn starts.\n\nWhile **ensnared**, a unit subtracts 2\" from its Move characteristic and cannot be **pinned**.",
